== DB-level pgvector benchmark (scripts/bench_pgvector.py) ==
Catalog sizes are EXACT: 1,000 rows, then 11,000 rows (1,000 + 10,000 synthetic).
Deterministic synthetic catalog: scripts/seed_catalog_scale.py (hash embeddings, PG-only).

